0-07:00</updated><title type='text'>wow. I&#39;m continually amazed at either the cowardic...</title><content type='html'>wow. I&#39;m continually amazed at either the cowardice, or Christian self-control of the family members of the victims that are introduced to us on this forum. If my daughter had to serve 6 years for the sake of a prosecutor&#39;s career, I would patiently, elaborately plan some private time between me and those responsible.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8155675161136443721/comments/default/4053203442761864949'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8155675161136443721/comments/default/4053203442761864949'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/02/felonious-hugging.html?showComment=1204185000000#c4053203442761864949' title=''/><author><name>Zachary</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05334525584242029389</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/02/felonious-hugging.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8155675161136443721' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8155675161136443721' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-995279443"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 28, 2008 at 12:50 AM"/></entry></feed>